  <p><strong>Note:</strong> All case studies on this page are illustrative sample engagements. They demonstrate AAJ's Diagnose → Design → Execute methodology applied to recognizable engagement shapes. They are not descriptions of specific named clients, and all metrics shown are illustrative.</p>
