  <ul>
    <li>B2B teams launching a new product, module, or pricing tier.</li>
    <li>Companies repositioning into a new category or segment.</li>
    <li>Marketing leaders who have inherited a launch with no plan.</li>
    <li>Founders running their first GA launch after a private beta.</li>
  </ul>

