    <div>
      <h3>What are the universal content quality standards?</h3>
      <p>Every asset must meet seven non-negotiables: source-backed accuracy (within 3 years), 0% plagiarism, Flesch readability 60+ (B2C) or 50+ (B2B), accessibility (alt text, captions, 4.5:1 contrast), brand voice consistency, legal compliance, and at least one clear CTA.</p>
    </div>
