<li><a href="/tools/survey-studio">Survey Studio</a> — Build multiple-choice, rating and open-text surveys, share by link, and export CSV results.</li>
</ul></section>
<section><h2>How to use these tools</h2>
<p>Most teams use the tools in three ways: as a one-off diagnostic before a planning cycle, as a recurring health check inside the monthly marketing review, and as a forcing function during a sprint with AAJ. The math behind each tool is documented on the tool page so the output can be defended in a board meeting, not just shown.</p></section>
